{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Now Supports English\uff01</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One-line Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <i>&quot;The Bell Echoes&quot;</i> is a narrative-driven SRPG Roguelite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/068310c58bec493166aad2cc4c2784d6.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/a4868c2c00e0306d801e8fd9e3e3dd17.poster.avif?t=1770699751\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/a4868c2c00e0306d801e8fd9e3e3dd17.webm?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/a4868c2c00e0306d801e8fd9e3e3dd17.mp4?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Man Squad \u00d7 Action-Oriented Turns</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to tedious map exploration and dive straight into an intense 8\u00d78 grid. You command a 3-person squad where each character wields up to 7 skills. Execute a full action combo in a single turn: <strong>&quot;Dash \u2192 Crowd Control \u2192 Chain Attack.&quot;</strong> Utilize height differences to suppress enemies behind cover, trigger chain damage via <strong>Knockback</strong> and <strong>Collision</strong>, and dodge fatal strikes with precise positioning. The grid may be small, but every move shifts the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/fc562d3fe13a0abb2b19f253a732d80d.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.poster.avif?t=1770699751\" width=854 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.webm?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.mp4?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every run, you must choose from a massive array of talents and skill variants, along with unique equipment and gems. Craft a unique, invincible squad that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/b2d48a9b538acc4a4ee8d8f6f3cec028.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/5b6e8564b5f8093c724d85ecd070ccd4.poster.avif?t=1770699751\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/5b6e8564b5f8093c724d85ecd070ccd4.webm?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/5b6e8564b5f8093c724d85ecd070ccd4.mp4?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your traditional &quot;Savior&quot; story. You must tread upon polluted lands to piece together the truth of <strong>&quot;Project Black Needle,&quot;</strong> surviving in the cracks between the Imperial Army, Marauders, and old allies. <strong>Remember: Don't jump to conclusions too quickly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/40a6ec6651c800eb40267f7dfae8f1cb.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/482e5ce3672ba7940e75dc2cb99f54b7.poster.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/482e5ce3672ba7940e75dc2cb99f54b7.webm?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/482e5ce3672ba7940e75dc2cb99f54b7.mp4?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this contaminated soil, combat consumes not just stamina, but sanity. When stress hits its limit, will your character fall into <strong>[Despair]</strong>, or awaken the power of <strong>[Meditation]</strong> in a desperate crisis? It all depends on your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave us a message in the Steam discussion group, or send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:382330596@qq.com\">382330596@qq.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873060?t=1770699751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.stea