and dive straight into an intense 8\u00d78 grid. You command a 3-person squad where each character wields up to 7 skills. Execute a full action combo in a single turn: <strong>&quot;Dash \u2192 Crowd Control \u2192 Chain Attack.&quot;</strong> Utilize height differences to suppress enemies behind cover, trigger chain damage via <strong>Knockback</strong> and <strong>Collision</strong>, and dodge fatal strikes with precise positioning. The grid may be small, but every move shifts the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/fc562d3fe13a0abb2b19f253a732d80d.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.poster.avif?t=1770699751\" width=854 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.webm?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/f6406a2909af981cb6d095fbfdbb44d0.mp4?t=1770699751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every run, you must choose from a massive array of talents and skill variants, along with unique equipment and gems. Craft a unique, invincible squad that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/b2d48a9b538acc4a4ee8d8f6f3cec028.avif?t=1770699751\" width=1280 height=183 /></span> </p><p class=