 stamina, but sanity. When stress hits its limit, will your character fall into <strong>[Despair]</strong>, or awaken the power of <strong>[Meditation]</strong> in a desperate crisis? It all depends on your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave us a message in the Steam discussion group, or send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:382330596@qq.com\">382330596@qq.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u4e03\u9897\u679a"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/c1d53edc1a81d43b2209d968783329563a827dc4/header.jpg?t=1770699751","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/567301478/dc6c8ef0ab85080a6664612d39be531c67d1b6b2/1770458740/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770459984","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/567301478/dc6c8ef0ab85080a6664612d39be531c67d1b6b2/1770458740/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770459984","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/567301478/dc6c8ef0ab85080a6664612d39be531c67d1b6b2/1770458740/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770459984","id":257281796,"name":"The Bell Echoes","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257281796/466052e67ab334243615038cc3a3221c042283c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770459984"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/1269905352/b11f94128fad0a3bf36a5eb99d32b1d9ae244b55/1768056508/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768057154","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/1269905352/b11f94128fad0a3bf36a5eb99d32b1d9ae244b55/1768056508/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768057154","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873